{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>I am too small for all the kindnesses.</b> I was not worthy of all those kindnesses." "<b>And all the truth.</b> The good that <b>You have done</b> with me by merit of my fathers, and in that same manner that You did with me beyond the line of justice — I ask that You deliver me, as it says: כְּגֹדֶל חַסְדֶּךָ וְכַאֲשֶׁר נָשָׂאתָ לָעָם הַזֶּה (Numbers 14:19)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:58.580031735Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}